tsc:TSC-CC3.1 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader tsc:TSC-CC3 ;
    skos:definition "Objectives are stated clearly enough that related risks can be identified and assessed; aligned with COSO 2013 principle 6."@en,
        "Les objectifs sont formulés assez clairement pour permettre de cerner et d'évaluer les risques connexes; correspond au principe 6 du COSO 2013."@fr ;
