tsc:TSC-CC5.1 a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader tsc:TSC-CC5 ;
    skos:definition "Control activities are chosen and built to bring risks to objectives down to acceptable levels; aligned with COSO 2013 principle 10."@en,
